'''Satori Hikami & Cat''' is a Special Cat that was introduced in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and was part of the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She was made to advertise the collaboration between the two franchises and to incentivize players to spread awareness about the event. Once players reached 3000 shares and likes on their [https://twitter.com/PONOS_EN/status/958897870563930112 #BattleCatsPlayBall Twitter Campaign] from February 1st, 2018 to February 7, 2018, Satori Hikami & Cat would be given to all players starting on February 15th.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 384
|rarity = EX
